{"ref":"BDB, מִכְמָס","hw":"מִכְמָס","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִכְמָס</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:27\" href=\"/Ezra.2.27\">Ezr 2:27</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:30\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.30\">Ne 7:31</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">מִכְמָשׂ</span> (v. Baer’s notes) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.2\">1 S 13:2</a> + 6 times 1 S, + 2 times;—city in Benjamin, N. from Geba and Jerusalem <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.2\">1 S 13:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.5\">5</a> (E. from Bethaven), v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:23\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.5\">14:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:31\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.31\">31</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.28\">Is 10:28</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:31\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.31\">Ne 11:31</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַנְשֵׁי מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:27\" href=\"/Ezra.2.27\">Ezr 2:27</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:30\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.30\">Ne 7:31</a>. 𝔊 Μαχ(ε)μας, etc. (On <em>Mikmās</em> v. Rob<sup>BR i, 440 ff.</sup> Buhl<sup>Geogr. § 96</sup>).","next":"BDB, כָּמַר","prev":"BDB, כָּמַס"}